; Workstream FACTS (item E1): native.scheme reads the shared ANF fact pass,
; which lives in the FACTS section of the pinned host module
; Elixir.BeamLisp.Optimize (priv/host/optimize.bl). The native closure compiles
; it as host.optimize and links every :remote to Elixir.BeamLisp.Optimize there.
; It calls the anf unit (BeamLisp.Ns.Anf), host.compiler-data (a base host
; module) and Erlang BIFs with registered leaves.
[{:ns "host.optimize" :path "priv/host/optimize.bl" :module :Elixir.BeamLisp.Optimize}]
